This project includes code adapted from OpenCV Zoo's NanoDet implementation
and demo at revision 47534e27c9851bb1128ccc0102f1145e27f23f98:
https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/47534e27c9851bb1128ccc0102f1145e27f23f98/models/object_detection_nanodet

Upstream contributor: Sri Siddarth Chakaravarthy, Google Summer of Code 2022,
OpenCV. The upstream code and model files are licensed under Apache-2.0;
the original license is included at docs/licenses/nanodet-LICENSE.

app/services/detection.py modifies that implementation for person filtering,
stable softmax, inclusive confidence thresholds, bounded immutable frames,
safe fault reporting and inference timing.

system/models/person.onnx and system/models/person_int8.onnx are the unmodified
FP32 and INT8 OpenCV Zoo NanoDet models. Their original filenames, revision
and SHA256 checksums are documented in docs/benchmarks/pi5-detection.md.

Local WAV recordings and camera footage are not part of the public distribution.
